  "source": "PHC Core Rules v1.0, rules revision 1.54 items 5 to 7 (Core Rules items 4108 to 4110); docs/design/survival-spec.md section 14.3",
  "about": "One converter for every recipe (packages/engine/src/recipes.ts; the reducer's gear/make {charId, recipe, times}). A row takes `needs` x times out of the pack and puts `gives` x times in it: free (no AP, no credits), only `where` (between_fights: never in a fight, never at 0 HP). `tool`: an item carried (a hand or the pack) or {focus: any}, any focus in a hand. `does`: the words after the tool in the refusal (\"Kade needs an ammo maker to make rounds.\"). A `gives` id is an item or `rounds:<calibre>`. The validator holds every row's needs worth what it gives at priceOf (rules 1.54 item 6: V/2 gunpowder and V/2 casings for rounds worth V).",
